---

## Layer Rules

| Layer | Directory | Rule |
|-------|-----------|------|
| Routes | `src/routes/` | URL mapping ONLY → call controller |
| Controllers | `src/controllers/` | Orchestrate services, no Prisma |
| Services | `src/services/` | Business logic, no Express, no Prisma |
| Repositories | `src/repositories/` | Prisma ONLY, no business logic |

---

## Naming Conventions

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Route file | `{entity}.routes.js` | `{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}.routes.js` |
| Controller | `{Entity}Controller` class | `{{ index .Entities 0 }}Controller` |
| Service | `{Entity}Service` class | `{{ index .Entities 0 }}Service` |
| Repository | `{Entity}Repository` class | `{{ index .Entities 0 }}Repository` |
| Test file | `__tests__/{entity}.{layer}.test.js` | `__tests__/{{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}.service.test.js` |

